{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>由 Strategic Designs Ltd. 開發的賽馬管理模擬遊戲 Horse Racing，現於 Epic Games 開放 PC（Windows）<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>領取，截止時間為 11 月 8 日 18:30（香港時間）。作品主打育種、訓練與騎師操作，玩家可建立馬房，並在全球賽事中爭取佳績。</p>\n<p>玩家要管理一整隊賽馬，安排訓練與出賽，繁殖新一代星級賽駒，並建設及擴充馬房，亦可親自擔任騎師落場策騎。官方簡介稱，遊戲收錄數以千計的馬匹、數百名騎師與練馬師，並以模擬真實賽事為重點，讓玩家在龐大賽馬世界中經營、育種、投注及比賽。</p>\n<p>其他特色包括即時評述引擎、報紙式賽事與往績卡、終身統計與血統資料，以及動態持續發展的賽馬世界和投注站競賽模式。作品另提供 Oculus Rift 的 VR 賽事體驗，收錄墨爾本盃、英國大障礙賽等世界級賽事，並具備跳欄賽模擬、終點攝影、賽事查詢、罰款及讓磅等細節。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】賽馬育種經營 Horse Racing 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Ss-1d39760b42e9332c2ba7431d299f476ab66e0671-1920x1080-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】賽馬育種經營 Horse Racing 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Ss-C7531ddde5361e8f4c8af2ae8e827c0162a4efa2-1920x1080-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】賽馬育種經營 Horse Racing 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Ss-F202183d356ecca1eb4ac848cf28fa64a8b5fd6b-1920x1080-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】賽馬育種經營 Horse Racing 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Ss-97dc8b404d6d4fe892abd9b77825b1a96c9c2b53-1920x1080-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\"/></figure>\n<p>遊戲名稱：Horse Racing<br/>支援平台：Windows<br/>領取位置：<a href=\"https://store.epicgames.com/p/horse-racing-4192a0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Epic Games</a></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:42:07.651471+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":444,"images":4,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T10:31:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T05:18:36.321267+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T10:38:42.953434+00:00","content_hash":"bc718095b762cdd02e0f18edc68a47559b4439399373cf209a7432df80697be4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:42:07.651471+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}